## Next Steps

* **Document Review**: WG members are urged to review `draft-ietf-deleg` and the DELEXT draft side-by-side to ensure internal consistency.
* **Secure Transports Draft**: Further discussion regarding the parameter design (explicit list vs. `no-do53` flag) will continue on the DELEG mailing list.